From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:06:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] BlueOS: DeskClock: BlueOS clock widgets

Three widgets next to the stock ones, in the system palette colors (accent,
dark theme) and the BlueOS clock font:
- Clock card: time with the minutes in the accent color, date, next alarm.
- Halo clock: no card, the halo over the minutes; dark or light text from the
  wallpaper colors (refreshed by SystemUI's WALLPAPER_COLORS_CHANGED).
- Clock tile (2x2): halo, hours over minutes.

Change-Id: I901a8239da04c675ed52d5edbb3906fe9724a72b
